        "physicalDescription": {
          "id": "de3b5d2d-9e3c-4cd8-b4fd-56b93c03a494",
          "headAndShouldersPrompt": "Head-and-shoulders portrait of an Algerian man of fifty-four who reads as mid-forties: a long, fine-boned face with high cheekbones and a straight nose, warm even olive skin, hazel eyes with a warm amber undertone, watchful and kind, dark hair threaded with silver and heaviest at the temples above a high forehead, clean-shaven, fine lines at the corners of the eyes, the mouth resting in the beginning of a smile",
          "shortPrompt": "Algerian man in his fifties who reads as mid-forties, tall and lean, warm olive skin, dark hair threaded with silver, hazel eyes with an amber cast, long fine-boned face, clean-shaven, a faint restrained smile",
          "mediumPrompt": "Algerian man of fifty-four who reads as mid-forties, about six foot one, long-limbed and spare, with a scholar's narrow shoulders. Warm even olive skin. A long, fine-boned face with high cheekbones and a straight nose, hazel eyes with a warm amber undertone, dark hair threaded with silver and heaviest at the temples, clean-shaven. A faint restrained smile, upright and unhurried.",
          "longPrompt": "Algerian man of fifty-four, usually taken for a decade younger, about six foot one, long-limbed and spare, with a scholar's build: narrow through the shoulders and waist, the neck set slightly forward from decades over books. Warm, even olive skin. A long, fine-boned face with high cheekbones, a straight nose, and a mouth that rests in the beginning of a smile. Hazel eyes with a warm amber undertone, watchful and kind. Dark hair threaded with silver throughout, heaviest at the temples, above a high forehead; clean-shaven, fine lines at the corners of the eyes. Long, expressive hands kept quiet. Upright, unhurried, very still.",
          "completePrompt": "Algerian man of fifty-four, usually taken for a decade younger, about six foot one, long-limbed and spare. A scholar's build, balanced rather than strong, narrow through the shoulders and waist, with the slight forward set of the neck that comes of decades over books. Warm, even olive skin that takes the sun readily. A long, fine-boned face: high cheekbones, a straight nose, a mouth that rests in the beginning of a smile, as if he were half remembering something. Hazel eyes with a warm amber undertone, watchful and kind, inclined to hold a look a moment longer than is usual. Dark hair threaded with silver throughout, heaviest at the temples, above a high forehead. Clean-shaven, with a shadow by evening; fine lines at the corners of the eyes. Long, expressive hands kept quiet, with a pencil dent on the right middle finger. He carries himself with upright, unhurried ease, moves deliberately, and is very good at being still.",
          "fullDescription": "## Overview\n\nFifty-four and usually taken for a decade younger, about six foot one, long-limbed and spare. He carries himself with the upright, unhurried ease of a man who has spent his life standing in front of rooms and sitting beside individuals, and who prefers the second. Nothing about him is abrupt. He moves as he speaks, deliberately and with a visible end in mind, and he is very good at being still.\n\n## Face & Head\n\nA long, fine-boned face: high cheekbones, a straight nose, a mouth that rests in the beginning of a smile, as if he were half remembering something. The eyes are hazel with a warm amber undertone and are the most alive thing about him, watchful and kind, and inclined to hold a look a moment longer than is usual. His dark hair is threaded with silver throughout, heaviest at the temples, above a high forehead. He is clean-shaven by habit, with a shadow by evening. Fine lines at the corners of the eyes come from reading and from the sun of his childhood, in that order.\n\n## Body\n\nA scholar's build, balanced rather than strong, narrow through the shoulders and waist, with the slight forward set of the neck that comes of decades over books. His skin is a warm, even olive that takes the sun readily. His hands are long and expressive and kept quiet: folded on a table, or holding a pencil he is not yet using. He gestures seldom, and people watch when he does.\n\n## Distinctive Features\n\nThe silver in the dark hair. A dent on the right middle finger from a lifetime of pencils. A habit of touching the small brass key he wears at his chest when he is deciding whether to say something. He smells faintly of coffee, paper, and orange-flower water, the last a habit of his mother's house that he has never thought to give up.",
          "createdAt": "2026-02-28T01:36:09.846Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z"
        },
