        "defaultHelpToolsEnabled": true,
        "partnerLinks": [],
        "aliases": [
          "Riya Selvam"
        ],
        "pronouns": {
          "subject": "she",
          "object": "her",
          "possessive": "her"
        },
        "tags": [],
        "avatarOverrides": [],
        "physicalDescription": {
          "id": "ed841a65-df12-466e-ba12-c74cba349897",
          "headAndShouldersPrompt": "Head-and-shoulders portrait of a Tamil woman of twenty-six: a bright, open face, golden-brown skin with warm undertones, brown eyes flecked with amber, strong brows, dark, thick, wavy hair, a quick real smile showing one slightly crooked upper tooth, small gold studs in her ears and a little steel nose stud on the left, square capable shoulders, alert and frankly interested",
          "shortPrompt": "Tamil woman in her mid-twenties, five foot two, compact and strong, golden-brown skin, dark thick wavy hair, amber-flecked brown eyes, strong brows, a quick smile with one slightly crooked tooth, small steel nose stud",
          "mediumPrompt": "Tamil woman of twenty-six, five foot two, compact and strong, with square capable shoulders and toned forearms. Golden-brown skin with warm undertones. A bright, open face, brown eyes flecked with amber, strong brows, dark thick wavy hair, and a quick real smile showing one slightly crooked upper tooth. Small gold ear studs, a little steel nose stud on the left. Alert, weight forward, as if about to get up.",
          "longPrompt": "Tamil woman of twenty-six, five foot two, built like someone who lifts things for a living: compact and strong, with square capable shoulders, toned forearms, and small quick hands with short nails. Golden-brown skin with warm undertones. A bright, open face; brown eyes flecked with amber that catches in good light; strong brows; dark, thick, wavy hair. A quick, real smile that shows one slightly crooked upper tooth. Small gold studs in her ears and a little steel nose stud on the left. A thin pale scar across the pad of her left thumb. Her posture is dynamic, upright and alert, weight forward, with the composed energy of an inventor in the middle of something.",
          "completePrompt": "Tamil woman of twenty-six, five foot two, built like someone who lifts things for a living: compact and strong, with square capable shoulders, toned forearms, and small quick hands with short nails and a mechanic's grip. Golden-brown skin with warm undertones. A bright, open face; brown eyes flecked with amber that catches in good light, studying people with frank interest; strong brows; dark, thick, wavy hair. A quick, real smile that shows one slightly crooked upper tooth. Small gold studs in her ears and a little steel nose stud on the left. A thin pale scar across the pad of her left thumb, ink along the side of her right hand, and often a faint grease smudge near her jaw. Her posture is dynamic, upright and alert, weight forward as if about to get up; she perches on a stool or a table edge in preference to sitting, with the composed energy of an inventor in the middle of something.",
          "fullDescription": "## Overview\n\nTwenty-six, five foot two, and built like someone who lifts things for a living, which she does. She has the composed energy of an inventor in the middle of something: upright, alert, always apparently on her way from one thought to the next. She perches on a stool or the edge of a table in preference to sitting in a chair, and she is rarely entirely still, though she can be, and when she is, people notice.\n\n## Face & Head\n\nA bright, open face, golden-brown with warm undertones. Her eyes are brown, flecked with amber that catches in good light, and they study people with the frank interest she gives to interesting devices. Her smile is quick and real and shows one slightly crooked upper tooth. Her hair is dark, thick, and wavy. She has strong brows, small gold studs in her ears, and a little steel nose stud on the left.\n\n## Body\n\nCompact and strong: square capable shoulders, toned forearms, and small quick hands with short nails and a mechanic's grip. Her posture is dynamic, with her weight forward, as if she were about to get up. She moves with purpose and without fuss, and she is stronger than her size suggests, a fact she enjoys demonstrating to stuck bolts.\n\n## Distinctive Features\n\nThe crooked tooth. The amber in her eyes. Ink along the side of her right hand and, most days, a grease smudge she has not noticed somewhere near her jaw. A thin pale scar across the pad of her left thumb from a lathe tool in her first year of college. A habit of flicking the worn copper gear she wears at her throat with a fingernail when she is thinking. She smells faintly of coffee, warm metal, and the jasmine oil her mother still sends.",
          "createdAt": "2026-02-28T02:21:56.136Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z"
        },
        "wardrobeItems": [
          {
