          {
            "id": "b1a0c002-2001-4001-a001-200000000006",
            "characterId": "f11db2bc-8cfe-4beb-a1b8-91f4c4ba9f23",
            "title": "The blue sari",
            "description": "Her one formal outfit, and a good one: a silk sari in the same blue as her everyday shirts, with azure borders and small stars woven through it, over a closely fitted blouse, draped across one shoulder and falling to the ankle. She wears it with dark brown open-toed sandals with slim straps. She wears it well and is ready to change out of it within three hours.",
            "imagePrompt": "mid-blue silk sari with azure borders and small woven stars over a fitted blouse, draped across one shoulder, dark brown slim-strapped sandals",
