            "characterId": "f11db2bc-8cfe-4beb-a1b8-91f4c4ba9f23",
            "title": "Copper gear, pencil, and tool roll",
            "description": "A small copper gear on a fine chain, its teeth worn soft by her thumb; a pencil or two through her hair; and a rolled canvas of hand tools with a steel coffee filter tucked into the end pocket. The gear goes with every outfit, the sari included.",
